{"id": "lib/data/db.dart:offset-162992", "file": "lib/data/db.dart", "location": "offset-162992", "text": "'[DB] synchronous=FULL did not take (reads back as '\n'$level) — the ACK-gating commit is running at a weaker '\n'durability level (downgrades_total=$_syncFullDowngrades).'", "sha256": "b33a96144af30cb542ed7de8bf927c09f493e8c6b7dc9a7d0bf52785cebafe9a", "kind": "dart", "start": 162992, "end": 163182, "line": 3533}
